WEBVTT

1
00:00:05,230 --> 00:00:05,980
I'm stupid

2
00:00:06,030 --> 00:00:07,230
Have you forgotten how your brother taught others?

3
00:00:07,230 --> 00:00:08,230
Brother will be gone from now on

4
00:00:08,230 --> 00:00:10,430
Protect yourself like a real man

5
00:00:10,430 --> 00:00:11,630
Don't cause trouble to anyone

6
00:00:12,030 --> 00:00:13,230
Our little show

7
00:00:13,230 --> 00:00:14,830
I have always been my pride

8
00:00:25,830 --> 00:00:28,630
Heaven is given to you, but you can’t leave it without leaving it

9
00:00:28,630 --> 00:00:29,830
You can't go anywhere

10
00:00:30,680 --> 00:00:32,080
It's Gong Yu'er and Hou Feng

11
00:00:32,080 --> 00:00:33,080
So what if it's me

12
00:00:33,080 --> 00:00:34,080
It’s you thunderballs

13
00:00:34,080 --> 00:00:35,280
Keep holding on to the dawn

14
00:00:35,280 --> 00:00:37,680
That's why we are getting worse and worse. Don't think I don't know.

15
00:00:37,680 --> 00:00:39,880
You are a space superpower and you are at the base every day

16
00:00:39,880 --> 00:00:41,480
Thief stealing supplies

17
00:00:41,480 --> 00:00:42,880
You losers

18
00:00:42,880 --> 00:00:45,280
Should we all have died long ago and regret it?

19
00:00:45,280 --> 00:00:47,080
There's no point regretting tonight
